OL,3,GNEWSAKarl Bushby completes English
OL,4,AChannel swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdventurer Karl Bushby says he has
OL,7,Fcompleted a multi-day swim of the
OL,8,FEnglish Channel, stepping foot on UK
OL,9,Fsoil after a 28-year journey.
OL,11,FBushby, 57, left Chile, South America,
OL,12,Fon 1 November 1998, following two
OL,13,Fself-imposed rules - not to use
OL,14,Ftransport to advance and not to return
OL,15,Fhome until the journey is complete.
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, he announced that he had
OL,18,Fswum from France to the UK - the final,
OL,19,Fmajor hurdle of his journey back to his
OL,20,Fchildhood home in Hull.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
