OL,3,GNEWSAKarl Bushby completes English
OL,4,AChannel swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FBushby said: "[It] feels good to have
OL,7,FUK soil under my feet after all these
OL,8,Fyears. It hasn't been easy, and that's
OL,9,Fpart of the point; proving I'm more
OL,10,Fcapable than I give myself credit for."
